 if I joined their group, positronics and all.

123
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:07,820
 You were intended to work with men.

124
00:13:07,900 --> 00:13:09,260
 We programmed you for that.

125
00:13:09,460 --> 00:13:12,070
 I'll be reprogrammed by them, then.

126
00:13:12,070 --> 00:13:17,080
 Oh, reprogram. Listen here, one more word and I'll send you off to the scrapyard.

127
00:13:17,740 --> 00:13:21,200
 It's always the scrapyard, the junk heap. It's all you think about.

128
00:13:21,800 --> 00:13:26,890
 Judents, I will not tolerate such insubordination. I warn you, who did I put together...

129
