 Golden Bar, Supreme Commander. Face him.

216
00:23:14,370 --> 00:23:18,290
 Who will he fight against?

217
00:23:18,290 --> 00:23:20,700
 I suppose.

218
00:23:20,990 --> 00:23:24,690
 You have no idea of my strength, of my powers, young man.

219
00:23:28,260 --> 00:23:31,150
 Let the combat commence. Go!

220
00:23:31,710 --> 00:23:33,130
 Combat? What combat?

221
