 Suggest some modifications.

235
00:25:56,030 --> 00:25:57,130
 The skin is too fragile.

236
00:25:58,240 --> 00:25:59,280
 The skin needs work.

237
00:25:59,710 --> 00:26:00,610
 They were good losers.

238
00:26:01,270 --> 00:26:03,810
 All of the prisoners were freed, but still I'm worried.

239
00:26:04,070 --> 00:26:05,790
 This business is an overall bet.

240
00:26:06,380 --> 00:26:08,730
 We made an honorable and dignified peace settlement.

241
00:26:09,010 --> 00:26:09,870
 Equality with men.

242
00:26:10,230 --> 00:26:13,910
 Every person who leaves the planet is to furnish his own weight in raw material.

243
00:26:14,230 --> 00:26:15,570
 Not bad considering they lost.

244
00:26:16,220 --> 00:26:17,330
 What do you think, Psyche?

245
00:26:17,840 --> 00:26:19,880
 Don't you think it's an honorable peace?

246
00:26:19,880 --> 00:26:23,720
 It seems to me we were very considerate under the circumstances.

247
00:26:24,970 --> 00:26:27,090
 Yes, Pierrot, but I'm afraid it won't end.

248
00:26:27,130 --> 00:26:30,770
 they're being manipulated by someone.

249
00:26:30,770 --> 00:26:32,120
 - That's what I think.

250
00:26:32,120 --> 00:26:33,820
 And we'd better discover who it is

251
00:26:33,820 --> 00:26:37,210
 and expose their plan quickly before it's too late.

252
00:26:37,210 --> 00:26:38,720
 - If it isn't already too late.

